.br
the \fIimages\fP directory
.br
a \fBwibble\fP does wobble
.sp
.B Macros
.br
The European [flag] is blue & contains ************ arranged in a [circle o].
.br
The \-> operator is often referred to as the stabby lambda.
.br
Since \f(CR++\fP has strong priority in AsciiDoc, you can rewrite C++ \(rA C++.
.br
sqrt(4) = 2
